  "title": "From Search to Watch: The Power of Roku’s Search Ranking System",
  "summary": "Authors: Kapil Kumar, Rahul Agarwal, Ratul Ray, Thanh Dang Searching for information is a crucial aspect of our daily routines. At Roku, we understand the importance of using search to quickly and efficiently discover and access content on our streaming platform. We developed a Search Ranking System that makes it easier for users to find the content … Continue reading \"From Search to Watch: The Power of Roku’s Search Ranking System\" The post From Search to Watch: The Power of Roku’s Search Ranking System appeared first on Engineering Blog .",
